<title>FRANCE: French CAC-40 index sets new all-time high at open.</title>
<headline>French CAC-40 index sets new all-time high at open.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's CAC-40 index of leading shares set a new all-time high at the open of the Paris stock exchange on Thursday, starting off at 2,700.43, or up 1.28 percent.</p>
</text>
